    },
    "body": [
      "⚠️ *Common Trap (Fettnäpfchen): Replacing ß with B. ß is a sharp S* sound, not the letter B!",
      "🧠 Memory Hook: If your keyboard lacks Umlauts, replace them with 'e': ä = ae, ö = oe, ü = ue, ß = ss.",
      "🇩🇪 *Cultural Insight (Kulturtipp): Germans use the DIN 5009 spelling alphabet over the phone (Anton, Berta, Cäsar, Dora...*)."
    ]
  },
